Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my blisters have blisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,that hits the spot you all right\Nyeah i'll be fine but if i knew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.45,0:01:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd be hiking i'd have worn better\Nshoes think that's bad try lugging
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,a dual disc good point i wonder\Nhow the other guys are me too if
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.55,0:01:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,all goes well it shouldn't be long\Nbefore we reach them teia good
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, don't make any sudden moves
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, Reptile, stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a step, I'm\Nright behind you What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You take a step, I'll be right behind\Nyou. How dumb do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.31,0:01:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't really want me to answer that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think flying into this light\Nshow is the best course of action
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it just some kind of weird illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but if it doesn't disappear\Nin the next two minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.81,0:02:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ordering this aircraft\Nto change course immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should do that now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.49,0:02:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.91,0:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.37,0:02:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna check it out myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did everyone go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Our entire team is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt they all have to use\Nthe bathroom at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, boys, but this\Nis a private party now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that voice. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We have some unfinished\Nbusiness to address, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair, show yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.19,0:03:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be in the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret showing\Nyour face again, Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's got the plane on autopilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he do with the rest of the crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.11,0:03:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be here. But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have taken them too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You never had a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.09,0:03:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They were an illusion all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.87,0:03:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where you're hiding, you coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair, no more games.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This plane's so big, you can\Npractically lose yourself in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So you better be careful\Nor you'll be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair, I thought I\Ngot rid of you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You got rid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how I remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my recollection,\NI defeated you. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.59,0:04:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's pointless\Nto argue about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you say you\Nand I have a rematch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a score to settle. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.85,0:04:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never see my brother again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your father took him away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's not responsible for\Nanything our father did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try telling\Nthat to my brother, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, let's say we go\Nahead with this rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.87,0:04:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you'll get out\Nof my life once and for all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this. Seto, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.15,0:04:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I'm always prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can prepare you for\Nwhat I'm about to unleash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As the challenger, I'll start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll summon my science\Nsoldier in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon X-Head Cannon in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, X-Head Cannon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If Alistar plays that Silabori\NKalkos, Seto's in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No big deal. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:06:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Cyber Soldier of Dark World.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I'll place one card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon White Dragon Head in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his Cyber Soldier\Nof Dark World now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, X-Head Cannon, attack\Nhis life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair's making this too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.19,0:06:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's just about\Nenough punishment for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.77,0:06:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound pretty confident, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll change your tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been so preoccupied\Nwith your own monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you forgot what I have waiting in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a card I used on you last time,\Nand it changes the entire playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.39,0:07:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just draw what I\Nthink you did, Alistair?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.73,0:07:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the seal of Orikalkos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.45,0:07:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Alistair?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I just needed some air,\Nthat's all. Isn't this better?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, punk, I've had just about\Nenough of your head games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So lose the magic act and\Nlet's get on with this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.51,0:08:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But my magic act is just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So pay attention, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing up my sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,for my first trick, I'll need a little help\Nfrom the dark powers of the Orichalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you a believer yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be soon enough. Now watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.37,0:08:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys up there somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The automatic pilot's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair must have somehow deactivated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.87,0:09:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.93,0:09:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't do something\Nquick, we're gonna crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go turn on oh no it's\Nbusted i got a radio for help
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,mayday this is kc1 anyone we've lost
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,control repeat we've lost control
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time for you to experience the\Npain that i felt thanks to your father
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.07,0:09:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever was in that smoke\Nis causing me to hallucinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.39,0:10:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm still on board that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You are now trespassing on Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,property.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone must evacuate\Nimmediately. To the hideout. Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know an illusion when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole thing is one big mind trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, bon appetit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this hideout's been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. So, scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't exactly plan on dinner for four.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So, go find your own grub, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what we went through to get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:10:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll tell you, we had\Na trek for like three miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Kaiba Corp shut down every single\Ngrocery store in the city. Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:10:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think we mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to kick us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in case you haven't noticed,\Nour town's been taken over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.01,0:11:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're not going to\Nwalk away without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So we grab what we can and bring it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And everything here belongs to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a chessboard just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember how to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the best. You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.11,0:11:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit yapping, Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you make yourself useful and go\Nback out there and get us some dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And take your new friend with you. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's gonna hang out with us,\Nhe may as well earn his keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you brats always this friendly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.77,0:11:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Only when we're in a good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not falling for any of this, Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:12:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So how long has all of this Kaiba\NCorp nonsense been going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, it seems like forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosaburo bought our land about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And when people wouldn't\Nleave, the tanks rolled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My stepfather must have caused all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.83,0:12:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't stay in\None place for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you never know where\Nhis men are hiding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we snuck underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what everyone does these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.65,0:12:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone that hasn't\Nbeen forced out, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But luckily, my friends\Nand I haven't been noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing we're short.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair had a hard life\Nthanks to my stepfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've seen enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea. When we\Nget back, let's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,chess we'll see if you really are the best
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,hey that's right by our hideout no
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:13:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,my friends hold on it's too dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They might be trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.99,0:13:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here\Nand find a new hiding place!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Alistair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get out here and face me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.75,0:13:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never win this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you honestly think your\Nmind games would distract me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trick's wearing off Believe\Nme, what you saw was no trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Those three kids, those were my\Nbest friends when I was growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.47,0:14:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We all looked out for one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Until your father ran us out of town, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you've had a taste of my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.05,0:14:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's tanks ruined my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now see how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm about to activate\Na trap card called Tank Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm adding it to my ultimate\Nweapon, the KC-1 Krayton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My trap card reinforces\Nmy tank with three others,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,plus an extra 1,500 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means my last attack\Nstripped you of 2,000 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe now you'll fear the\Nrumble of tanks like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I place this face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With my army to protect\Nme, you're as good as gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,because next turn my tanks\Nare going to destroy you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.49,0:15:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,just like your father destroyed my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play chess! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find my friends! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.93,0:15:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Seto! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,because I activate my monster\Nreborn to bring back Y Dragonhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I summon my Z-Metal Tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.83,0:15:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch and learn as I\Ncombine my monsters together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet XYZ Dragon Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll activate my new\Nmonster's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up one of my cards, so I can\Nautomatically destroy one of your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.07,0:16:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that your trap is gone,\Nso are your backup forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.81,0:16:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And with no rear defense, your\Npuny tank doesn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, cannon attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have expected hostile\Nbehavior like that from you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.47,0:17:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the son of\NGozabora Kaiba! Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing in common with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Could've fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more alike than you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And so's the rest of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just face it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This planet's full of\Nnothing but hatred and greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I found that\Nout the hard way years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The same lust for power\Nthat drove your father
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,to do what he did to\Nmy friends and family!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My family is still alive today, and\Nthere's a little bit of it in everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's all gonna change with\Nsome help from my new family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we plan to do away\Nwith all the evil ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can rebuild the world into\Nthe paradise that it once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There'll be no such thing as Kaivacorp,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and people like you will\Nget what they deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,An eternity locked away where\Nyou can't hurt anyone ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wouldn't worry about this plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.57,0:18:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your soul you should\Nbe concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mokuba's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.51,0:18:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, my phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.73,0:18:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control it! Mokuba! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not finished with you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.49,0:18:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you thought the seal of Ori Kalkos\Nwas bad, wait till you see what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.07,0:18:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, why\Nshould I make you wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When I can end it all right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,this plane's out of control\Nand you're about to lose
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.37,0:19:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,the last duel of your career\NI'd say this isn't your day
